    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54319" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακύλλωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a particular case of lameness</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύλλωμα</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1599.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>turning-point</i>: hence, <i>extreme point</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πέρας τῶν κακῶν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> (post <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοκάς</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				761.38
			</span></i>.</div>
